ne. Successor challenges added (NOVELTY_CHALLENGES.md §C8, §C8.b). **Cross-domain ingredient**: NONE imported (paradigm-shift mode). Tools used: Möbius inversion + completely-multiplicative property of `λ`, both already-`USED` in CROSS_DOMAIN_TECHNIQUES.md from prior sessions. See `experiments/constructions/wheel_coprime_liouville_identity/{definition.md, wheel_coprime_liouville.py, wheel_coprime_liouville_results.md, wheel_coprime_liouville_results.json, run.log}`, `archive/sessions/session219_paradigm_shift_wheel_liouville.md`. | 219 |
